# ============================================================
# DEPRECATED — Pi-hole v6 no longer reads this file.
#
# Local DNS records moved to pihole.toml in Pi-hole v6, managed
# via env vars in Docker deployments. The real source of truth
# for these records is now the FTLCONF_dns_hosts environment
# variable in servers/gateway/docker-compose.yml — update it
# there, not here.
#
# This file is kept only as a historical reference for what
# records exist; it has no effect on the running system.
# ============================================================

